Z||000000||GT Bastard||10-14-1999||04:44 AM||||Ahhhhh yes, it's late at night and I can't wait to wake up at 7:00am.  I think I may just have to make this an all-nighter, because I can't sleep.  So what exactly am I posting on a Fiero message board for?  Who knows?  .............. Maybe I was just pondering the meaningful/meaningless game of life.  How exactly should I live??  Maybe I should build my life around the recycling of Tuna cans.... Maybe I should become a born-again Christian..... Maybe I should start a Kiss cover band..... Or maybe I should devote myself to priciple alone.... Ahhhhhhhh well.  Does anyone here have a "happy place?"  I mean, do you ever close your eyes and visualize yourself being somewhere else where nobody can touch you?  I don't know about everyone else, but I'm a fan of visualization, and it works!  I always think of the same thing..... <BR>I sit on a grassy hill in the middle of a vast ocean of infinite depth.  There's an overcast in the sky, but that's the way I like it.... It makes me feel secure.. And there sits an old friend with me... She was my first "real" girlfriend, and her name was Sarah(I still talk to her, but it's not the same anymore).  I think she always pops in my head because she had the most beautiful blond hair... It was so soothing just to look at her.  I always picture a sorrowful look on her face, like she's just learned some grave news.  Not sure why I always paint that picture in my head... I've grown so fond of that image that I sometimes wish I could leave everything behind and BECOME it.  I always half-expect this image of her to somehow tell me what I need to do with my life, but she never does.... Damn, I think I'm suffering from sleep deprivation.  Any thoughts or opinions?  sorry for the long post....<P>later,<BR>Jeff ||||reg||5
